<title>MALAYSIA: Cement Industries 9-mth net up 25 pct.</title>
<headline>Cement Industries 9-mth net up 25 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to Sept 30, 1996</p>
<p>		    (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		   73.56	  vs	 58.91</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	  55.8	   vs	 44.6</p>
<p>    Turnover		    343.70	  vs	265.44</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	     77.53	  vs	 51.39</p>
<p>    Minorities less	     2.45	  vs  less  0.70</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)	   10.0	   vs	 10.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Company's full name is Cement Industries of Malaysia Bhd. It makes and sells cement and cement bags and is also involved in quarrying.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
</text>
